[{"title":"次韵燕中舍若水苦雨五绝句 其四","author":"刘摰","text":"声入高梧翠竹边，故携枕簟北窗前。\n无端唤起江南梦，记得扁舟夜不眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44472,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵燕中舍若水苦雨五绝句 其五","author":"刘摰","text":"嘉谷连空指岁丰，幽潜无复有乖龙。\n何时浩荡风吹日，照彻阴云几万重。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44473,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"泛舟南湖二绝句寄公秉二首 其一","author":"刘摰","text":"路转芳洲面面风，回环惭愧刺船翁。\n画桥东北桃花坞，时有飘红落酒中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44474,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"泛舟南湖二绝句寄公秉二首 其二","author":"刘摰","text":"不知芳物过春风，傲兀扁舟怯浪翁。\n得似王猷剡溪上，何须范蠡五湖中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44475,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"木芙蓉","author":"刘摰","text":"谁染轻红皱万囊，靓如妆面照寒塘。\n蜀葵千叶仍陪菊，芍药重台更耐霜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44476,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖上口号三首 其一","author":"刘摰","text":"绿荷深不见湖光，万柄清风动晓凉。\n莫恨红葩犹未烂，叶香元自胜花香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44477,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖上口号三首 其二","author":"刘摰","text":"湖上清怀各自知，凉风吹我独依依。\n吏曹姑去母催我，待得临流弄月归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44478,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖上口号三首 其三","author":"刘摰","text":"柳色映花春岸北，人家临水画桥南。\n回舟欲向东城望，恰似清溪玉镜潭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44479,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六月二十日湖上四绝句 其一","author":"刘摰","text":"莲的纷纷玉手来，欲攀莲叶卷狂杯。\n冰浆未见菱腰折，珠实何时芡觜开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44480,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六月二十日湖上四绝句 其二","author":"刘摰","text":"红蕖白藕满平湖，曾爱新梢玉不如。\n今日水深那可得，野人盘上欠香蔬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44481,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六月二十日湖上四绝句 其三","author":"刘摰","text":"气候凄炎倾刻中，晚来宜此一樽同。\n乍收荷叶萧骚雨，便得蘋花细碎风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44482,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六月二十日湖上四绝句 其四","author":"刘摰","text":"浓云忽忽遍天围，四面凉风弄客衣。\n霹雳一声湖雨白，鱼儿惊没鹭狂飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44483,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪中次韵王巩廷平四绝句 其一","author":"刘摰","text":"此时遥忆子猷家，幽兴应思剡水涯。\n未向东风见琼树，且传春色赠梅花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44484,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪中次韵王巩廷平四绝句 其二","author":"刘摰","text":"渐飞大片纷如靴，更扑惊风乱似麻。\n为谢妻孥衣但典，莫愁米贵酒难赊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44485,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪中次韵王巩廷平四绝句 其三","author":"刘摰","text":"檐边骚屑竹声乾，炉畔龙钟病骨寒。\n坐想兰歌倾桂酒，清虚堂上有馀欢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44486,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪中次韵王巩廷平四绝句 其四","author":"刘摰","text":"袁安秖有高眠兴，谢眺空伤后会难。\n十万健儿春瘴近，飞花宜过海南山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44487,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"平原君","author":"刘摰","text":"徒称馆舍三千客，岂救长平百万军。\n焉在平原多得士，功名翻属信陵君。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44488,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"信陵君","author":"刘摰","text":"客赵忘梁久不归，先王宗社若巢危。\n归来未久秦人入，魏国存亡亦可悲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44489,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"甘罗","author":"刘摰","text":"甘罗徒挟虎狼威，入赵安能策是非。\n大抵诸侯畏秦尔，一言轻得五城归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44490,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"汲黯","author":"刘摰","text":"汲黯刚纯社稷臣，张汤巧诋更平津。\n贤人所贵忠邪异，惜对君王论未伸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44491,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵龚谏议辅之同游灵岩寺","author":"刘摰","text":"琳宫仙老鬓虽霜，不厌山头石径长。\n杖履更为他日约，姓名聊记旧碑旁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44492,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏李质夫","author":"刘摰","text":"曾醉江梅烂漫时，北乡寒冷见花迟。\n知君独倚瑶林赏，不向春风赠一枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44493,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再赠李质夫","author":"刘摰","text":"赠春须记折花时，坐恨江南信息迟。\n还向瑶林主人问，东风应傍去年枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44494,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绝句","author":"刘摰","text":"日日新诗出锦囊，清言飘洒句琅琅。\n幕中病客疲酬报，走马真难伴放羊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44495,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东郊次韵器资子开六绝句 其一 见早梅","author":"刘摰","text":"几年空有忆梅诗，常恐江南驿使迷。\n惭愧一枝偿病眼，春风须劝笛声低。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44496,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东郊次韵器资子开六绝句 其二 见早梅","author":"刘摰","text":"刻玉沾酥三两枝，霜空林杪早春时。\n萧疏仙骨闲相并，缈缥幽香冷自知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44497,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东郊次韵器资子开六绝句 其三 见早梅","author":"刘摰","text":"江南诗客两仙才，携手东原赋早梅。\n琼树令人常愿见，还家何事更徘徊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44498,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东郊次韵器资子开六绝句 其一 谩成","author":"刘摰","text":"五日重来蹑马尘，此君时节已残春。\n吹衣拂面寒犹峭，谁道春风似故人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44499,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东郊次韵器资子开六绝句 其二 谩成","author":"刘摰","text":"悄悄轻冰断水涯，欣欣群木荫人家。\n春风巧思无寻处，红白青黄各自花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44500,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东郊次韵器资子开六绝句 其三 谩成","author":"刘摰","text":"昔年花卉烂春林，今日重来老病侵。\n岁月漫为流俗叹，行藏谁见古人心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44501,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九月十八日离魏都寄内二首 其一","author":"刘摰","text":"南鸿无计与同飞，鸿翼翩翩我马迟。\n若过平台寄家信，为言今日是归期。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44502,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九月十八日离魏都寄内二首 其二","author":"刘摰","text":"肃肃霜风吹客衣，客怀多少寄金徽。\n到家细说淹留事，应笑苏秦困始归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44503,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄倩","author":"刘摰","text":"近时颇少飞鸿信，几日应占喜鹊声。\n相见便须持宝镊，为翁衰鬓摘霜茎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44504,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题齐己草堂","author":"刘摰","text":"一曲流泉对草堂，何人与续帐前香。\n清诗自共秋风老，依旧钟声送夕阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44505,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"路作茅斋成有诗次其韵","author":"刘摰","text":"鬋予会到冈，心休境自适。\n丈室居士家，环堵儒者宅。\n常令小博山，一种袅馀碧。\n燕雀来贺否，应笑檐牖窄。\n跬步是清溪，间可就泉石。\n庭花秋娟娟，窗月夜寂寂。\n灯火亦可亲，隐几对方册。\n不为寒辍冬，穷居忌矫激。\n可大亦可小，人或未知识。\n戏问广厦人，谁思万里客。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44506,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"清明后一日下沙","author":"刘摰","text":"微风吹□幸阴晴，笑侧吟鞭十里行。\n时节早蚕生谷雨，人家新火接清明。\n衮衣犊鼻均无物，篱鴳云鹏各有情。\n欲挹浮丘挽春驭，尊罍定得泻东瀛。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44507,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三老堂","author":"刘摰","text":"三老非隐者，乡里道义人。\n缔交何绸缪，白首情益亲。\n进退小或异，归于重其身。\n逸老田北效，筑堂北溪上。\n野拙彼二老，招迹日俱往。\n幽泉弄清泠，平野得遐旷。\n谓近隔城市，谓远非山林。\n青岑落尊酒，白云贮衣襟。\n岁月付清醉，志蕴还长吟。\n颓俗可以敦，媮风为之重。\n人生苦飘忽，事往真幻梦。\n但闻三人墓，萧萧木已拱。\n朅来抚陈迹，春衣吹我衣。\n墙边见残萼，屋角悬斜晖。\n雍琴感今昔，辽鹤惊是非。\n世故无足言，徘徊坏墙下。\n思人爱树木，况此岿然者。\n子孙固无忘，又将告里社。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44508,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"石棋局","author":"刘摰","text":"坚平宜荷明堂柱，方洁当函玉牒书。\n且拂尘埃伴君坐，一枰相与寄清虚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44509,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"刘摰","text":"杳杳三韩国，煌煌二使星。\n海神无横暴，天子有威灵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44510,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"刘摰","text":"阴阴佳木发城齐，襟袖迎风弄晚晖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44511,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"刘摰","text":"轩宇凭虚出半天，忽惊身寄碧云端。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44512,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其五","author":"刘摰","text":"方雄望三楚，形势拱中原。\n阔占潇洒腹，高摩翼轸门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44513,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"临化作","author":"陈景元","text":"昔之委和，今之蜕质。\n非化非生，复吾真宅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44514,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏作示内","author":"晏几道","text":"生计唯兹椀，般擎岂惮劳。\n造虽从假合，成不自埏陶。\n阮杓非同调，颜瓢庶共操。\n朝盛负余米，暮贮藉残糟。\n幸免墦间乞，终甘泽畔逃。\n挑宜筇作杖，捧称葛为袍。\n傥受桑间饷，何堪井上螬。\n绰然真自许，嘑尔未应饕。\n世久轻原宪，人方逐子敖。\n愿君同此器，珍重到霜毛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44515,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题司马长卿画像","author":"晏几道","text":"犊鼻生涯一酒墟，当年嗤笑欲何如。\n穷通不属儿曹意，自有真人爱子虚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44516,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观画目送飞雁手提白鱼","author":"晏几道","text":"眼看飞雁手携鱼，似是当年绮季徒。\n仰羡知几避缯缴，俯嗟贪饵失江湖。\n人间感绪闻诗语，尘外高踪见画图。\n三叹绘毫精写意，慕冥伤涸两踟蹰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44517,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚春","author":"晏几道","text":"一春无事又成空，拥鼻微吟半醉中。\n夹道桃花新过雨，马蹄无处避残红。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44518,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"予嘉祐中尝迎先妣来主临潼元祐丁卯□月赴守遂宁复过是邑凡山林宫寺之胜皆当日奉板舆盍朋簪岁时游息之处到今二十八年矣因成短诗以叙感慨","author":"李梃","text":"凄凉感旧与怀亲，时事居人触目新。\n独有温泉故情在，犹能为我洗红尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44519,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挈家登朝元阁晚由东山北下自石瓮过朝元山路并斯飞亭皆当日亲为开置今复经从因留拙句","author":"李梃","text":"一别骊山岁已深，林花依旧绣苍岑。\n归寻当日新开路，隐约苔痕下翠阴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44520,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题灵泉观","author":"李梃","text":"山原缭绕水萦纡，绣岭屏风立座隅。\n更上朝元最高处，饶君都看渭川图。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44521,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠关渊圣学士","author":"孔夷","text":"吴越声飞二十年，缁衣空复叹遗编。\n紫芝眉宇风尘外，太白文章锦绣前。\n可是石渠方载笔，未应水国要归田。\n他时雪里相逢处，能记骑驴孟浩然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44522,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"陪李端叔游颖昌西湖三首 其一","author":"孔夷","text":"霜风吹老菊离离，水外秋云送雁飞。\n来伴谪仙闲杖屦，满林丹叶衬斜晖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44523,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"陪李端叔游颖昌西湖三首 其二","author":"孔夷","text":"楼影摇波到碧空，拒霜无数隔堤红。\n只应明夜关山月，怜我相思不寐中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44524,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"陪李端叔游颖昌西湖三首 其三","author":"孔夷","text":"与世相疏行路难，不禁尘土便思山。\n山中独念故人远，雪舞清声窗竹闲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44525,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄高邮王定国","author":"孔夷","text":"世路难行肯效尤，蒲萄斗酒换凉州。\n春风不到仲文树，野水犹沈梦得舟。\n珍重故家青玉案，徜徉乡社翠云裘。\n淮南十里莺花老，月照关山笛里愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44526,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"孔夷","text":"微雨鹭翘艇，夕阳人倚楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44527,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梨花 其二","author":"孔夷","text":"雨晴梨花春有光。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44528,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"孔夷","text":"砌下梨花一堆雪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44529,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"曾点","author":"吕大钧","text":"函丈从容问且酬，展才无不至诸侯。\n可怜曾点推呜瑟，独对春风咏不休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44530,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"曾公岩和曾子宣安抚","author":"苗时中","text":"红旆寻幽东郭旁，泉岩新得冠殊方。\n一川气象天开作，万古荆榛地蔽藏。\n崖穴乍惊堂室辟，榜名知与日星长。\n异时人指溪桥水，思爱还同召伯棠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44531,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"家定国","text":"桃李从花王。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44532,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"家氏客","text":"笙歌陪酒圣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44533,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"郑雍","text":"访古直寻齐守事，诵诗还爱紫微才。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44534,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"换苏印和弟颖叔 其一","author":"蒋之翰","text":"耻向承平便拂衣，乡邦还得拥旌麾。\n昔年曾预儿孙列，投老犹疑笔砚随。\n忠义一门均许国，箕裘万石亦遭时。\n朝廷虚日方圆任，功业当看帝载熙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44535,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"换苏印和弟颖叔 其二","author":"蒋之翰","text":"从来疏拙懒身谋，揽辔登车已倦游。\n幸有醉乡为乐地，何妨吟啸老东州。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44536,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"海州观放鹘搏兔不中而飞去","author":"沈括","text":"秋霜濯空林，暮日在峰顶。\n冥冥起长风，稍稍绝遗影。\n骁禽值猛搏，俯取不待顷。\n岂非求者乖，矫翮成远聘。\n未能谢榛莽，那用遽悼悻。\n此心竟可怜，得失未宜病。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44537,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"姑熟溪 其一","author":"沈括","text":"新晴渡口百花香，石子池头鸭弄黄。\n卷幔夕阳留不住，好风将雨过梅塘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44538,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"姑熟溪 其二","author":"沈括","text":"豹堂春水绿泱涣，谢市云深柳线长。\n睡熟不知潮信过，船头晚雨打菰蒋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44539,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"慈姥矶 其一","author":"沈括","text":"碧山丛丛遮塔晖，苍崖万丈涵苍漪。\n西风隔江动高树，山前过帆如鸟飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44540,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"慈姥矶 其二","author":"沈括","text":"朝发铜陵暮扬子，年年白浪江中归。\n江人收身苦宜早，一生却向江中老。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44541,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"江南曲","author":"沈括","text":"新秋拂水无行迹，夜夜随潮过江北。\n西风卷雨上半天，渡口微凉含晚碧。\n城头鼓响日脚垂，天际笼烟锁山色。\n高楼索莫临长陌，黄竹一声无北客。\n时平田苦少人耕，唯有芦花满江白。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44542,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"峨眉亭","author":"沈括","text":"双峰秀出两眉弯，翠黛依然监影间。\n终日含颦缘底事，祗应长对望夫山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44543,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"承天观","author":"沈括","text":"上士修真地，曾无俗混淆。\n云根起坛级，江面出松梢。\n轩静檐垂斗，窗虚洞接茅。\n何当脱尘滓，来结皎然交。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44544,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鞦韆","author":"沈括","text":"香入熏炉禁火天，芙蓉深苑斗秋千。\n身轻几欲随风去，却恨恩深不得仙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44545,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]